# SKID KIDS: PIPPA (Amy's kit). She gets up in half the time; her special
# throw is the RIPPLE (a wave along the floor to the far wall that bowls over
# everyone in its way and nudges what lies on the floor); her move is the
# GUST (for a while everything on the floor is blown toward the other wall).
game skidkids
wait 5
cheat match 1 0 3 11 0
cheat coach 0
cheat clearbags
cheat freeze 1
cheat freeze 2
cheat freeze 3
cheat play
expect who0 == 1
cheat kid 0 100 100
cheat bag 150 100 -3 0 1 1
wait 20
expect kst0 == 5
expect timer0 < 40
waituntil kst0 == 0 40
cheat clearbags
# the ripple: both kids in its band go down, a point each
cheat kid 2 220 90
cheat kid 3 240 115
cheat stars 0 2
cheat give 0 1
hold B 70
wait 2
expect waves == 1
expect n_sthrow == 1
waituntil waves == 0 120
expect score0 == 2
expect kst2 == 5
expect kst3 == 5
expect bagx0 > 290
# the gust: a bag lying on her side slides over and hits
waituntil kst2 == 0 100
waituntil kst3 == 0 100
cheat clearbags
cheat kid 2 220 60
cheat kid 3 220 150
cheat loose 130 150
cheat stars 0 2
press A
wait 4
press A
expect gust > 0
waituntil score0 == 3 150
